{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_security_password_reset", "label": "send-password-reset Flow (2026-09-15)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Brokered by an edge function that answers account existence (owner-requested, replacing the former P3-9 neutral posture) but stamps a DB-backed 60 s per-email cooldown for FOUND and NOT-FOUND alike, so existence-probing is rate-limited as hard as mail spamming; links target the bare allowlisted /auth/callback."}, {"id": "docs_security", "label": "SECURITY.md \u2014 SpendFlow Web", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_security_csp", "label": "Content-Security-Policy Posture (Non-Nonce)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Implemented 2026-09-14: connect-src/img-src pinned to the four outbound origins, frame-ancestors none, HSTS; deliberately non-nonce because nonce CSP would force dynamic rendering on every page (static landing, /preview*, CDN), and 'unsafe-inline' is accepted since app code has no HTML sinks \u2014 remote-script/egress lockdown carries the defense; it is also the compensating control for ssr session state readable by JS."}, {"id": "docs_security_exif_reencode", "label": "Avatar EXIF/GPS Canvas Re-encode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phone-camera JPEGs carry GPS/device/timestamp metadata; since avatars land in a public-read bucket, images are canvas re-encoded (<=512 px webp/jpeg) client-side before upload so metadata never reaches it (audit P2-3), and stored avatar_url is validated to the avatars-bucket prefix on write and render (P3-2)."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_security", "target": "docs_supabase", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security", "target": "docs_security_csp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security", "target": "docs_security_password_reset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security", "target": "supabase_tests_rls_regression_sql", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a77", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security", "target": "docs_schema_live_drift", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security_csp", "target": "docs_architecture_ssr_session", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security_exif_reencode", "target": "docs_supabase_avatars_bucket", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security_password_reset", "target": "docs_supabase_oauth_redirect_allowlist", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/SECURITY.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_security_password_reset", "target":